\begin{description}
\item[Identity-lane gate.] This gate decides at which lane an identity-edge attempt is accepted, if any.  In Paper~10 the accepted edges are treated in \Cref{subsec:protocol-indexed-acceptance}.  The gate classifies identity scope and does not by itself license event-level records.

